Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: mt7615: include the MAC address parser header

The firmware debug control calls mac_pton(). Include its declaring header
explicitly after newer kernels stopped providing it through kernel.h.

--- a/mt7615/debugfs.c
+++ b/mt7615/debugfs.c
@@ -1,5 +1,6 @@
 // SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause-Clear
 
+#include <linux/hex.h>
 #include "mt7615.h"
 
 static int
